Default appearance assets
The default portrait, its cartoon reference and the glasses crop depict an
AI-generated fictional person. The iPhone and Mac share the
Avatar/yimi-portrait.jpg and Avatar/yimi-cartoon-reference.jpg source resources;
the glasses use drawable-nodpi/yimi_face.jpg. These project assets are included
under Apache-2.0.
